---
---
<a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Mind of KV — home">
  <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">kv</span>
  <span class="word">mind of <b>kv</b></span>
</a>
<style>
  .logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; }
  .mark {
    display: grid; place-items: center; width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); font: 600 0.95rem/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    position: relative;
  }
  .mark::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; right: -3px; bottom: -3px; width: 10px; height: 10px;
    border-radius: 3px; background: var(--accent);
  }
  .word { font: 500 1.15rem/1 var(--serif); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .word b { font-weight: 600; }
</style>
